# Town Greeter: "mill four cards. You may put a land card from among them into your hand." Bot2's Dauthi Voidwalker
# exiles each card that would go to Bot1's graveyard, but a milled card is found in the public zone it went to
# (CR 701.17c): the exiled Starting Town is still among them, Bot1 takes it, and a Town card put into hand gains 2 life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest x3
Town Greeter
Forest x5
Starting Town
Forest
Island
Swamp
Forest x6

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Dauthi Voidwalker
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Dauthi Voidwalker.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Town Greeter.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Starting Town)

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 22
Bot1.Hand = Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Forest; Starting Town
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Exile = Swamp; Island; Forest
Bot1.Library.Count = 6
